title: "Six chords are exactly enough for 41 <= n <= 67: minimal pancyclic graphs found by AI agents (Erdős Problem #1016)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pinckard
    given-names: Joshua
    email: josh@toolsenabled.ai
